{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Junkichi": 71,
    "Player": 20,
    "Shigeru": 36
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2201001",
      "subQuestName": "Visit Shigeru and Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100201": {
            "id": "220100201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "In the chapter I'm working on, the main character is preparing for the next big fight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100202"
            ]
          },
          "220100202": {
            "id": "220100202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "He needs a powerful weapon... Let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100203"
            ]
          },
          "220100203": {
            "id": "220100203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Let's go check out the Amenoma Smithy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201002",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Amenoma Smithy with Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100601": {
            "id": "220100601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Sparks fly as hammers clash against anvils...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100602"
            ]
          },
          "220100602": {
            "id": "220100602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Amenoma Smithy is such place full of passion!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100603"
            ]
          },
          "220100603": {
            "id": "220100603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Blacksmiths turn rough billets and ore into powerful weapons using such simple tools.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100604"
            ]
          },
          "220100604": {
            "id": "220100604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "If alchemy is used while forging, wouldn't it be possible to create indestructible weapons?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100608",
              "220100607"
            ]
          },
          "220100608": {
            "id": "220100608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Yes! That's a good idea. The main character shall have the strongest weapon! One forged using alchemy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100609"
            ]
          },
          "220100609": {
            "id": "220100609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Now, this weapon needs to have an awesome name... and an awesome backstory.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100610"
            ]
          },
          "220100610": {
            "id": "220100610",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "That's it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100611"
            ]
          },
          "220100611": {
            "id": "220100611",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Traveler, let's go back. I'm going to tell Shigeru about my idea."
          },
          "220100607": {
            "id": "220100607",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "What do you mean? Isn't alchemy the kind of thing that makes the impossible possible?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201003",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Tsukumomono Groceries with Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100701": {
            "id": "220100701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Tsukumomono Groceries sells all kinds of goods similar to the items collected during my character's adventure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100702"
            ]
          },
          "220100702": {
            "id": "220100702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I mean, Aoi always says that \"one man's trash is another man's treasure.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100703"
            ]
          },
          "220100703": {
            "id": "220100703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Hmm... It seems like finding out what the buyer values is the key to selling goods at a high price.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100704"
            ]
          },
          "220100704": {
            "id": "220100704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "But if I write it like this, I'll have to spend time describing psychology. It doesn't fit the theme.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100705"
            ]
          },
          "220100705": {
            "id": "220100705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "...Why don't I just make the main character a psychic that can intuit the needs of the buyer?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100707",
              "220100709"
            ]
          },
          "220100707": {
            "id": "220100707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "It's character development. It's okay. Don't worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100710"
            ]
          },
          "220100710": {
            "id": "220100710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Well, there we have it, then! I know what to write!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100711"
            ]
          },
          "220100711": {
            "id": "220100711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Traveler, let's go back. I'm going to tell Shigeru about my idea."
          },
          "220100709": {
            "id": "220100709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Plot basis... hmm, I'll think about it while I write. It shouldn't be a problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201004",
      "subQuestName": "Observe the Doushin with Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100801": {
            "id": "220100801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "The Doushin keep the peace in Hanamizaka. No criminals can escape their watch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100802"
            ]
          },
          "220100802": {
            "id": "220100802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "In the story, the enemy's knights have the same duties as the Doushin. But to make it interesting, let's make them ten times as strong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100804"
            ]
          },
          "220100804": {
            "id": "220100804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Number scales are the clearest thing in the world. That'll help us show how powerful the main character is!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100806"
            ]
          },
          "220100806": {
            "id": "220100806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Well, I'll... give the main character mastery over disguises. Like being able to freely change their appearance and voice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100807"
            ]
          },
          "220100807": {
            "id": "220100807",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is this some new character trait?...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100808"
            ]
          },
          "220100808": {
            "id": "220100808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "This is the main character's hidden ability. An encounter with certain enemies is the best time to reveal it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100809"
            ]
          },
          "220100809": {
            "id": "220100809",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey, you just made that up, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100810"
            ]
          },
          "220100810": {
            "id": "220100810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "N—No... It was my plan all along. C—Come on, now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100811"
            ]
          },
          "220100811": {
            "id": "220100811",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Anyway, let's just go with that. Time to go tell Shigeru about my idea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201005",
      "subQuestName": "Go back to the Yae Publishing House to find Shigeru",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100501": {
            "id": "220100501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "I hope this month's issue can be printed on time..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201006",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100916"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100916": {
            "id": "220100916",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Actually, Junkichi's idea isn't bad...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100917"
            ]
          },
          "220100917": {
            "id": "220100917",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Not bad? If he keeps going like this, he's going to confuse even himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100918"
            ]
          },
          "220100918": {
            "id": "220100918",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Hahaha, you see? The Traveler's on my side. That means my idea is appealing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100919"
            ]
          },
          "220100919": {
            "id": "220100919",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "The most important thing in a novel is an exciting and attractive plot. I'm writing with that in mind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100920"
            ]
          },
          "220100920": {
            "id": "220100920",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "*sigh* You...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100921"
            ]
          },
          "220100921": {
            "id": "220100921",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Come on, relax. I know what I'm doing. It will definitely get unanimous praise. You'll see."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201007",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100922"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100922": {
            "id": "220100922",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Actually, Shigeru sounds more reasonable...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100923"
            ]
          },
          "220100923": {
            "id": "220100923",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Reasonable? Reasonableness is no substitute for a good plot. A reasonable plot would be boring without a compelling story!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100924"
            ]
          },
          "220100924": {
            "id": "220100924",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "You... mark my words, when it comes time to wrap up the story, you'll go crazy trying to tie up the loose ends!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100925"
            ]
          },
          "220100925": {
            "id": "220100925",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I—I took some notes. We won't have any problems ending the story!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100926"
            ]
          },
          "220100926": {
            "id": "220100926",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "You have to take notes to remember all the details, do you? Are you expecting the readers to take notes as well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100927"
            ]
          },
          "220100927": {
            "id": "220100927",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Uh... Well...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100928"
            ]
          },
          "220100928": {
            "id": "220100928",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "I'm not saying you can't add these new features. I'm just saying that you have to be mindful of how many there are and when they are added.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100929"
            ]
          },
          "220100929": {
            "id": "220100929",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Writing a novel is like running a marathon. If you go too hard at the start, you'll just lose steam later on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100930"
            ]
          },
          "220100930": {
            "id": "220100930",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "The key to a successful novel is to move forward steadily, one step at a time. Trust me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100931"
            ]
          },
          "220100931": {
            "id": "220100931",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Okay, okay... *sigh*..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201001",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100101": {
            "id": "220100101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Junkichi, the deadline to turn in the manuscript is tomorrow. No more delays!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100102"
            ]
          },
          "220100102": {
            "id": "220100102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "There's no use pushing me! I'm stuck at a critical point in the story and I've got writer's block.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100103"
            ]
          },
          "220100103": {
            "id": "220100103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you two arguing about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100104"
            ]
          },
          "220100104": {
            "id": "220100104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "...Traveler! Just the voice of reason we need.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100105"
            ]
          },
          "220100105": {
            "id": "220100105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "I'm Shigeru, an editor at the Yae Publishing House. This is Junkichi, the writer I'm in charge of.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100106"
            ]
          },
          "220100106": {
            "id": "220100106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "His new novel, \"Onibudo,\" is very popular. But he never meets his deadlines. Sometimes he even delays for weeks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100107"
            ]
          },
          "220100107": {
            "id": "220100107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "And he's at it again, of course. If he doesn't turn his manuscript in by tomorrow, I won't be able to get this month's issue into print.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100108"
            ]
          },
          "220100108": {
            "id": "220100108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Why don't we postpone the issue? Our loyal readers will still pay for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100109"
            ]
          },
          "220100109": {
            "id": "220100109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Don't be ridiculous. If it isn't updated regularly, the novel's reputation will go into the trash!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100110"
            ]
          },
          "220100110": {
            "id": "220100110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "But I've just got no inspiration right now, and I'm not going to write some garbage chapter. There's just got to be an interesting story!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100111"
            ]
          },
          "220100111": {
            "id": "220100111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "But all the other writers are basically done. You're the only one left!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100112"
            ]
          },
          "220100112": {
            "id": "220100112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Maybe Junkichi really just needs a bit of inspiration...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100113"
            ]
          },
          "220100113": {
            "id": "220100113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "That's right! My friend here gets me. I need inspiration!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100114"
            ]
          },
          "220100114": {
            "id": "220100114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I'll go around and look for some — I'm sure something will come to me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100115"
            ]
          },
          "220100115": {
            "id": "220100115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Hey! That's the excuse you used last time to put it off. We're not doing this again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100116"
            ]
          },
          "220100116": {
            "id": "220100116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I'm not lying this time. Come on, trust me just this once!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100117"
            ]
          },
          "220100117": {
            "id": "220100117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Hmm... All right. Fine. But this is the last time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100118"
            ]
          },
          "220100118": {
            "id": "220100118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "No further delays! Got it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100119"
            ]
          },
          "220100119": {
            "id": "220100119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Okay, okay, I got it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100120"
            ]
          },
          "220100120": {
            "id": "220100120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Phew... I guess I can't put it off this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100123"
            ]
          },
          "220100123": {
            "id": "220100123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Were it so easy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100124"
            ]
          },
          "220100124": {
            "id": "220100124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "But we have to do it somehow, or Shigeru will turn my house upside down..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201003",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100301": {
            "id": "220100301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "In the chapter I'm working on, the main character is trying to sell the items he collected during his adventure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100302"
            ]
          },
          "220100302": {
            "id": "220100302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "That will involve dealing with different types of buyers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100303"
            ]
          },
          "220100303": {
            "id": "220100303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Hmm... Then let's go to Tsukumomono Groceries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201004",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100401": {
            "id": "220100401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "In the chapter I'm working on, the main character sets off alone into enemy territory.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100402"
            ]
          },
          "220100402": {
            "id": "220100402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Gathering information is crucial to fighting the enemy. How should I write this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100403"
            ]
          },
          "220100403": {
            "id": "220100403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Hmm... let's go check out the Doushin at work."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201009",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220100901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220100901": {
            "id": "220100901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I found inspiration at Amenoma Smithy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220100902"
            ]
          },
